+# Long-stay discount
+
+A rental of 3 days or more costs 10% less than its full price (days × daily price). Applies to `quote` and
+`book`, which both show the reduced total. Rentals of 1 or 2 days are unchanged.
+
+- Total stays an integer number of euro cents: the reduced price is rounded half up.
